cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Project Grove"
message: "If you use or refer to this project, cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Noext/gta-sa-port"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial PC port of Grand Theft Auto: San Andreas for PS3 (BLES02219), made by static
  recompilation of the game's PowerPC code to C++ with a reimplemented PS3 system library layer
  and a Vulkan RSX backend. Contains no game material.
keywords:
  - ps3
  - static-recompilation
  - vulkan
  - linux
